Package: gnss-detection
Version: 0.1.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), python3 (>= 3.12), libssl3 (>= 3.0)
Maintainer: quantumworld-dpdns-io <admin@quantumworld.io>
Description: GNSS Spoofing/Jamming Early Warning System
